# riscv_shell in the emulator's window (ECP5_GUI_SCRIPT; see gui/src/trace.rs).
# The window runs it at about 0.85 MHz, so the Mandelbrot calculation plus its
# UART output takes about 5 s. Typed text waits in the design's FIFO.
# Buttons are held for a second: the design debounces them for 10 ms
# (250 000 clocks), which the window takes about 0.3 s to run.
0 rate max
0 run
1 board 3d
2 type help\r
5 type led 5a\r
7 type calc 6*7\r
9 type mandel\r
18 type calc 1+
19 button 1 down   # FIRE1: an event line in the middle of a typed line
20 button 1 up
21 button 6 down   # RIGHT: another
22 button 6 up
24 type 2\r
26 type knight 2\r
43 type primes 2000\r
60 quit
